id: pm-q5grv5
title: Isolate merge reconciliation receipt discovery from unrelated invocation workspaces
description: "An explicit non-Git tracker currently reads clone-local receipts from process.cwd when no Git root is found, causing foreign item repair attempts and failed reconciliation. Match health and validation by anchoring receipt lookup to the requested tracker, with an isolated two-workspace regression."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-09-11T13:20:57.763Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-11T13:45:57.583Z"
closed_at: "2026-09-11T13:45:57.028Z"
completed_at: "2026-09-11T13:45:57.028Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 60
acceptance_criteria: Explicit non-Git tracker dry-run and apply ignore foreign invocation-repository receipts; Foreign receipts remain pending and unchanged; Existing exact-proof reconciliation and legacy disposition tests pass
value: Keep SDK workspace identity explicit and prevent unrelated project context leakage
outcome: Reconciliation reads and settles evidence in the requested tracker workspace
why_now: Whole-suite verification found reproducible foreign receipt repair attempts
parent: pm-dj98
risk: medium
confidence: high
severity: high
resolution: Anchor receipt discovery and settlement to the explicit tracker workspace
expected_result: A non-Git tracker never consumes receipts from an unrelated invocation repository
actual_result: Real two-workspace preview/apply regression and existing legacy and receipt-proof integrations pass; exact repository coverage 100/100/100/100 and linked tests passed.
component: sdk/merge
